# A door opens fully, stays open while the player is near, and closes when
# the player walks 3 cells away. The door at column 31, row 17 is opened by
# setting its open bit, as a click on it does.
save 2
watch 31 17
hold left 2
hold up 22
set_cell 31 17 b210
wait 10
check opened
hold down 30
check walked_away
wait 10
check closed
end
